1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,536
Nobody arrives at your
clip having watched

2
00:00:02,536 --> 00:00:04,078
the previous
nine minutes.

3
00:00:04,473 --> 00:00:06,827
They arrive mid-scroll
with no context and

4
00:00:06,827 --> 00:00:08,178
a thumb already moving.

5
00:00:09,614 --> 00:00:12,596
So the only question
that matters is:

6
00:00:12,596 --> 00:00:15,774
does the first line
of this clip work on

7
00:00:15,774 --> 00:00:18,638
somebody who has
never heard of you.
